"Incredible app .. allows me to run all my essential linux console programs on my tablet or phone, with or without external bluetooth keyboard.  Eg: Emacs/tramp editing over VPN; full access/editing of my encrypted org-mode files (synced with dropbox/dropsync); monitoring phone's resources with htop. And, if I'm at someone else's computer and need access to my stuff, I can just ssh into my phone and enjoy the convenience of big screen/keyboard/mouse with my portable server! :-)  Yeah, it's slower than a desktop, but surprisingly usable.  Before this, I had thought seriously about loading ubuntu onto my tablet to get this type of portable linux environment, but honestly, termux gives me pretty much everything I need (console-based for now), plus android .. best of both worlds!  Just when I'm already blown away, I find other really stuff in the well-written docs: multiple-sessions, keyboard enhancements (such as: press volume down to simulator ctrl),  termux-api (send/read SMS, text-to-speech etc.) ... just incredible.   Great community and support too.  Keep up the awesome work Fredrik, thank you.",5,2017-03-07 01:54:23
